# These requirements are installed into the recipe image when you publish the
# package. `ellf publish code` reads them from the package metadata, and the
# broker installs them on the cluster and adds them to the base image.
#
# Only list what the base recipes image doesn't include. The requirements are
# installed with `pip install --target`, which ignores the packages already in
# the image, so every package listed here is downloaded again and added to the
# image layer. `ellf-recipes-sdk` is in requirements-dev.in instead, because
# listing it here would also install spaCy, boto3, google-cloud and psycopg2.
#
# The notebooks also use pandas and altair, which the base image already
# includes. Listing them here could replace the versions the rest of the image
# depends on.
marimo >= 0.24.0, < 0.25.0
